lass=\"candich\">そうですね。②<u>この <ruby>資料<rp>(</rp><rt>しりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を コピーして</u> おいて ください。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Ừ nhỉ. Hãy copy sẵn tài liệu này nhé.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">はい、わかりました。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vâng, tôi biết rồi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>会議<rp>(</rp><rt>かいぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② この レポートを <ruby>読<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みます</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>出張<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅっちょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② <ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい カタログを <ruby>準備<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅんび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>します</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 3</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai30/renshuuC-3.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000110000.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><ruby>手伝<rp>(</rp><rt>てつだ</rt><rp>)</rp>